{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_08_end","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":18,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_08_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-8","storyName":"夜尽之时","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在还火的歌声里，拉芙希妮战胜黑雾与内心的动摇，走入紫火，使属于死亡的紫色蜕变为标志新生的橙色。在火光中，红龙复生，黑暗消散。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_08_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_08","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":16,"next":18,"characters":["“校官”","爱布拉娜","阿赫茉妮","巨龙","拉芙希妮","布莉吉","敏感的居民","涅梅丝","？？？","“放逐王”"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_bg_50_g13_warshipcommandroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#6$1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"殿下，“歌唱家”刚刚来告发“雄辩家”等人挟持拉芙希妮前往小丘郡。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我知道了。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"他专门挑了人员已经开拔，“领袖”已经启程前往小丘郡的时候告发，这样就既不用得罪“雄辩家”他们，又不能算知情不报......","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"我们拿他怎么办？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"深池本来也不需要他去做眼线。没人指望他来干这个。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"非常抱歉，这是我的失职，我以为他们只是在按照命令向小丘郡进发，没想到他们竟敢挟持拉芙希妮。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"趁他们还没走远，现在出发，我们还追得上......","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":24},{"type":"charslot","id":25},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#7","duration":"1.5","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"殿下，我替您的妹妹带来消息。她希望您能制止“雄辩家”等人的盲动，将她带回这里。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"这是她本人的意愿？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FD/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#7","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"没错。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"我这就去调动部队——","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"慢着。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"殿下，现在制止他们的确是较好的选择。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#7","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"而且，“不想去小丘郡”，这也的确是拉芙希妮自己的意思。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"既然这真的是她自己的意思，她理当亲手将其付诸实现。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"对她的火而言，这并不是什么难事。她不是已经以“领袖”之名执行了许多人的死刑了吗？","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"去告诉她，如果她想，就自己去做——","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"不，连这也不必了。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#3","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"殿下，恕我冒昧，她毕竟是您的——","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"妹妹？","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#7","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"......","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-7.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":59},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":63},{"type":"text","text":"巨龙扇动着钢铁的翅膀，掀起冰冷的，燃烧着的涡流，而拉芙希妮未曾动摇半分。","id":64},{"type":"text","text":"她将枪尖狠狠刺入巨龙的眼窝。","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巨龙","text":"还是没法下定决心杀死我吗，拉芙希妮？","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"巨龙的声音逐渐与爱布拉娜的重合，连身躯都幻化成爱布拉娜的形状。","id":67},{"type":"text","text":"周围的景物也飞速改变，一如那个跟随拉布雷德在遗迹中度过的夜晚。","id":68},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g8_blackforest_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ncrmcr_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act22side/m_bat_ncrmcr_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":75,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":76},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_deathburning","layer":"1","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我只是......不懂。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你究竟要什么？","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你欺骗我，欺骗所有人，就为了一座城市为你陪葬？为了什么？为了成为下一个盖尔王传说？","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我并没有骗你。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"事到如今，你觉得我还会相信吗？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"纳斯尔纱对你来说究竟是什么？塔拉对你来说究竟是什么？","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我一直相信，我们要实现的是同一个梦想。为什么此时此刻，我们的梦已经完全两样了呢？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"难道对你而言，梦想也会在你追逐权力的路上变成令人厌倦的无聊把戏，就像......","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"就像小丘郡那时的......拉芙希妮一样吗？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"小丘郡？","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"那时我在你眼中看到的不是回归的渴望，而是解脱，不是吗？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"至于我，是啊，小丘郡那时，我的确已经厌倦了。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我可以用火将一切熔成想要的形状，却唯独只有镜中的影子......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"无论我燃起多大的火焰，她都不会有分毫改变。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......因为你从未直接用火焰去灼烧她。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"因为我从未直接用火焰去灼烧你。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我只是在等，一直在等，等你给我一个回答。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"回答？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"bgeffect","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"charslot","id":118},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":119},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_34_i04.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"——你呢，拉芙希妮？你想要什么呢？","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你的血脉与教养让你高尚，这是好事，可你要是一无所求，我又该在身边留什么样的位置给你呢？","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"说吧，这可是雪夜里的愿望......多么大的野心，我都允许。","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":126},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":131},{"type":"image","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_deathburning","layer":"1","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你的确并未用火焰灼烧我，因为你有更合用的工具，恐惧、责任、愧疚、同情......","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你从未直接要求我改变什么，但你已经无数次间接地这么做了。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我的影响毫无作用，我的厌倦却得到了回报，很讽刺，不是吗？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"无论如何，你终于愿意回来，愿意拥抱真实的生活，这就够了。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"阴谋、权欲、战争，这就是你眼中唯一真实的生活吗？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"不是吗？故事、诗歌、传说，你觉得这才是你和我值得享有的生活？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......我知道，我一直觉得愧疚，我恨自己不能为你分担那些痛苦。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"是我的逃避让你一个人背起全部，让它们将你塑造成了如今的样子——","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"不，拉芙希妮。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"这些天来我时常在想，你其实和我一样傲慢。不同的是，我的傲慢朝向整片大地，而你的傲慢只对准我。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"什么？","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"为什么你会觉得，阴谋、权欲、战争，是它们将我塑造成形呢？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我从未被它们改变，是它们碰巧长成了能让我得心应手地挥舞的样子，仅此而已。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"些微的权力决定一个人的生死，更多的权力决定一支军队的存亡，滔天的权力决定一个国家的兴衰......","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"而权力终有尽头。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"诗人们很早就知道这件事，你也该明白的，不是吗，拉芙希妮？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"死亡平等地嘲弄所有人，为一切权欲熏心的人设置了命定的终点，在那一刻把他们一生的追求狠狠夺走，毫不留情。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你明知道这是一条没有结果的路，为什么还要......？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"text","text":"爱布拉娜在后退，钢铁铸成的巨龙骸骨在后退。","id":172},{"type":"text","text":"是要逃脱吗？是在躲闪吗？","id":173},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮下意识地卸力，却又在下一刻咬紧嘴唇，陡然加大力道，把爱布拉娜推向前方。","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"很好，你至少已经学会了离开我之后的生活所需要的最基础的东西。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......残忍？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"坚决。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"既然认定了这条路就是自己的生活，那就往前走，再别想着回头。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这话你该去对全纳斯尔纱的人说——","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"让我把最后的话说完，拉芙希妮。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"死亡将所有人嘲弄......而我，将嘲弄死亡。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"祝福我吧，拉芙希妮，因为这场伟大的冒险终于就要启程。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"爱布拉娜不住地后退，脸上的笑容比任何时候都更加缥缈不定。","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"贯穿钢铁的手感慢慢软化，变得像是贯穿身躯般顺畅，而后像是贯穿火焰般空虚——","id":193},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"bgeffect","id":197},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":198},{"type":"charslot","id":199},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":200},{"type":"image","id":201},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_bg_bg_light.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":203},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spear","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":206},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_daggerslow","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":208},{"type":"text","text":"直到一股如回光返照般的巨力自枪尖传来，将拉芙希妮拉向对面。","id":209},{"type":"text","text":"冰冷的火焰缠上身躯时，拉芙希妮猛然意识到，自己已经踩在了纳斯尔纱堡垒门口，红龙广场，还火仪式的中央。","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"又或者，那紧紧和她纠缠在一起的红龙骸骨只是回到了原来的位置，顺势把紧握着枪的拉芙希妮带进了葬礼中心的火中。","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你想再放跑我一次吗，拉芙希妮？","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"——！！","id":213},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","fadetime":"1.5","screenadapt":"coverall","id":215},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_purple_fire","fade":"true","fadetime":"2.5","layer":"3","x":"45","y":"30","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮的枪尖放射出前所未有的明亮光芒。","id":218},{"type":"text","text":"如同内脏被反复撕裂的灼痛在一瞬间爆发，生命的火焰在死亡正中央爆散，爆散，直到那杆武器承受不住过载的法术，自身也燃起烈火。","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"巨龙的骸骨摩擦碰撞，宛如千百张口同时唱起各自的悲歌。","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"火焰的温度缓缓上升，爱布拉娜的身形也渐渐变得稀薄。","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮的嘴唇颤抖着，想吐出道别的话语，在心中翻遍读过的书籍，却想不到合适的词句。","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_tara_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":224,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#2$1","duration":"2.5","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#1$1","duration":"2.5","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"在消散前最后一刻，爱布拉娜缓缓用手臂环住拉芙希妮。","id":228},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"永别了......直到死亡让我们重逢。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1685_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"希望你喜欢我给你的临别赠礼。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1685_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"临别......赠礼？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1684_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1684_1#25$1","focus":"l","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"3.5","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","duration":"3.5","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"charslot","id":248},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":249},{"type":"image","id":250},{"type":"bgeffect","id":251},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":252},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_purple_fire","fade":"true","fadetime":"3.5","layer":"3","x":"45","y":"30","id":255},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":256},{"type":"text","text":"广场上伫立哀悼的人们对火中的一切浑然不知。","id":257},{"type":"text","text":"他们看见的唯有越烧越旺，已经遮住了台座、棺椁、红龙雕塑、整座堡垒，甚至还在向上攀升的火焰。","id":258},{"type":"text","text":"火焰扭曲了红龙骨骸雕塑的形状，人们已经分不清那龙是在振翅飞翔，在与仇敌死斗，还是被贯穿了头颅，发出沉痛的悲鸣。","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"人们沉默着，在火光中努力辨认着雕塑的姿态，但一切都只是徒劳——","id":260},{"type":"text","text":"直到布莉吉惊呼出声。","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"bgeffect","layer":"3","fadetime":"3","id":263},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_yellow_fire","fade":"true","fadetime":"3.5","layer":"2","x":"25","y":"30","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"火的颜色变了！","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"火的颜色变了。","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"宛如从地底刮来的强风将烛天的紫火卷成漩涡，而漩涡底部，棺椁那里，升起了一轮小而炽烈的太阳。","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"整个漩涡仿佛被照亮一般，自底至顶，从幽深的紫，化为明亮的黄。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"火堆旁的所有人都向后退去，因为火焰突然有了温度，险些将他们灼伤。","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"蒸腾的热量四散，就连悲伤的涓流也被烤干。","id":271},{"type":"text","text":"也许奇迹即将出现，此刻，每个人心中都只剩下这个念头。","id":272},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2.5","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277},{"type":"bgeffect","id":278},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_bg_38_g21_skystarry_R2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":280},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"一个奇迹，一个我为了塔拉，不得不承受下来的奇迹......","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这就是你给我准备的临别赠礼吗，姐姐？","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"爱布拉娜已然彻底死去，爱布拉娜无法回答。","id":284},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮试图回想刚刚那个拥抱，其中究竟多少是被满足的期许，多少是一点点温情，又有多少是冰冷无情的算计。","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"又或许，对爱布拉娜而言，这些东西本就密不可分。","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你说得对，爱布拉娜。","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"如果这就是你最终的目的，如果你非要将这顶浸染了血的王冠戴在我的头顶，那么，没错。","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"永别了。","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"直到死亡为止，我们都不会再重逢。","id":291},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fireburst","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"charslot","id":296},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_59_i11.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_sys_act22side_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act22side/m_sys_act22side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":298,"musicid":3},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"45","block":"false","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3.5","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"text","text":"火焰的漩涡呼的一声散开。","id":302},{"type":"text","text":"红龙，带领塔拉人走过漫漫长夜的红龙，正从雕塑中央，朝着整个纳斯尔纱走来。","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"她的表情被烈焰模糊，她的身形却坚实如大地上延续不息的生命。","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"一步，一步。","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"她的双足踏过尚余紫色的棺椁，木制的灵柩化作灰烬，其中没有任何人的尸体，只有领袖一直在用的那杆喷吐火焰的枪。","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"人群屏住呼吸，广场安静如临盆的产房之外，或是埋上了最后一铲土的墓地之中。","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"唯有火焰跳动不息。","id":309},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我可以原谅你对我做过的一切，爱布拉娜，只有这份临别赠礼......我永远不会原谅。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":313},{"type":"subtitle","text":"从过去到现在，你的名字将与无数建立了塔拉的名字一起沉入遗忘的深渊。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":314},{"type":"subtitle","text":"塔拉的红龙只会是拉芙希妮·都柏林。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":315},{"type":"subtitle","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我回来了。","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"带领你们反抗维多利亚，争得独立与自由的红龙——","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"拉芙希妮·都柏林......从死亡的深渊归来了。","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我为了消解你们焚身的烈焰而死，而你们为我哀悼的泪雨浇灭了火焰，让我从死亡的深渊中归来。","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这一次，我不会再驱策你们死去。","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"伟大的事业已然完成，再没有什么东西应当让无数塔拉人献出自己的生命，却只留下残垣和哭声。","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我希望，我衷心希望，每一个塔拉人都能收敛自己的火，那从奴役中来，从压榨中来，从屈辱中来的，千百年从未熄灭的悲伤的火。","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我不需要你们将它遗忘，我只是希望，你们能像先祖曾做的那样，将那火焰变成一盏灯。","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"一盏首先温暖自己，然后......","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"替我们所有人照亮前路，让我们能在故土真正开始欢笑，开始歌唱，开始生活的......","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"明亮的，温柔的灯。","id":329},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"bgeffect","id":334},{"type":"image","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainheavy_loop","channel":"r","loop":"true","volume":"0","id":336},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":338},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"人们还在细细咀嚼红龙话中的意味，某个再普通不过的纳斯尔纱居民突然痛呼出声。","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"敏感的居民","text":"好痛！为什么我手上的烧伤突然痛起来了？","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"敏感的居民","text":"等等，你们身上源石灯的颜色......","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"敏感的居民","text":"连我身上的源石灯的颜色也变了？","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"这就是红龙希望你们能够提在手中，温暖自己、照亮前路的灯。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"紫色的火焰只属于死者，而我们在不知不觉中让自己的火焰被太多的死亡和失去染成了紫色。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"可我们却错将那火认成祝福，放任自己也被拖进死亡的深渊......","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"若是今晚红龙没有杀死自己，或者我们没能为她还火，到了现在，所有人都会死去，变成被死亡驱动的行尸。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1687_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"敏感的居民","text":"为了熄灭我们身上的死火，这就是你刚刚说的......红龙杀死自己的理由？","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1687_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":358},{"type":"text","text":"紫火退去后忽然升腾起来的罪恶感让涅梅丝没有答话，只是轻微点了点头。","id":359},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"忽然，她觉得脸上一凉。","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"一滴水落在她的脸上，于是她抬起头，望向遥远的夜空。","id":363},{"type":"text","text":"几次呼吸之后，更多的人抬头望去，潮湿的雨滴打在他们脸上，温柔地洗去泪痕。","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"下雨了。","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"charslot","id":369},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_cg_rainsplash.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":371},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":372,"musicid":4},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.7","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"text","text":"这场夏末节前夜的雨越下越大，人群却仍要留在广场上。他们要感谢红龙把生命还给他们，感谢红龙分开了生命与死亡。","id":376},{"type":"text","text":"而红龙告诉他们，在每一个人都回家安睡之前，她会一直站在那里。","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"于是人群渐稀，就连守灵人和流民们也向红龙告辞。他们担心遗迹附近还会聚集没能还火的亡灵，尽管这担心是多余的。","id":378},{"type":"dialog","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"charslot","id":382},{"type":"text","text":"日升之后，塔拉的土地上再也没有死者徘徊。","id":383},{"type":"text","text":"涅梅丝也哽咽着向红龙告辞。第二天，她起得很早，四处收集砖石，她要帮库林的工坊重新修起一扇门。","id":384},{"type":"text","text":"偌大的广场变得空空荡荡，只留下一位红龙，和一位游牧民。","id":385},{"type":"dialog","id":386},{"type":"charslot","id":387},{"type":"image","id":388},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":390},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"布莉吉，你接下来要去哪里？","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......我也没什么地方可去吧。也就是接着帮助大家传信，预报天灾......","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"然后，渐渐被更有效率的......那个词怎么说的来着......“天灾信使”？给取代吧。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"毕竟我的族人也越来越少了，这份工作有人能接手，我还挺高兴的。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"也许你也可以和罗德岛联系一下。","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"罗德岛，那是什么？","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"一家医药公司，一群很好的人。你要找的是他们的总部，一艘陆行舰。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我明天会写一封信给他们，请你帮我送去吧。你会喜欢那里的。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"至于今晚......你就先在堡垒里睡一晚。雨这么大，就别在广场上搭帐篷了。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C3/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我们先去堡垒门口吧。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C3/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"charslot","id":412},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":414},{"type":"text","text":"两人向着堡垒的方向缓缓走去。","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"大雨倾盆，雕像上的火焰几乎彻底被浇灭，只有红龙的眼窝处，还有一缕不辨颜色的火苗微弱地跳动着。","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"两人背后忽然传来说话声。","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"要我说，愚蠢和倔强还真是代代相传。","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"怎么会有人连自己打过的赌都能忘掉的？","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"广场上还有人吗？","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"是那位看不见的弟兄，他和我打了个赌。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"看不见？","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"拉芙希妮，别回头。","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"他是个很别扭的家伙，他一定不喜欢被人看见，这才总是神出鬼没。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":433},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":434},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":435},{"type":"charslot","id":436},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","duration":"1.5","id":440},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......哈。","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":443},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":444},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":445},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":446},{"type":"charslot","id":447},{"type":"text","text":"看着红龙眼眶里跳动着的火苗，拉布雷德依稀想起几百年前的事情。那时艾里尔还是个正在变声的男孩，他自己的胡子则刚刚冒出脸颊。","id":448},{"type":"dialog","id":449},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_59_g11_castlecorridor_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","y":"-50","id":450},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","xTo":"-100","duration":"45","block":"false","id":451},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":452},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":453},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":454},{"type":"text","text":"已有“华贵王”之名的梅里亚德在王城中推行维多利亚的一切，终于，塔拉人寻常的赌约习俗也被禁绝。","id":455},{"type":"text","text":"就在那天，拉布雷德与母亲爆发了有史以来最激烈的争吵。","id":456},{"type":"text","text":"事后，母亲勒令他斋戒静心，可艾里尔偷偷摸进兄长的卧室，为他送去了一大块肉排。","id":457},{"type":"text","text":"兄弟俩在屋内吹灭灯火，大快朵颐，直到连手指也快舔干净，艾里尔说，别犟了，王城里的所有人都会变成维多利亚人的。","id":458},{"type":"text","text":"拉布雷德摩挲着自己尚且柔软的胡子，只是摇头。他问，要不要打个赌，就赌母亲去后，没人愿意继续在王城里假扮维多利亚人。","id":459},{"type":"text","text":"艾里尔说，行。","id":460},{"type":"text","text":"年长的那个大笑起来。那咱们还得赌点什么。赌什么好呢？就赌这顶王冠吧，假如最后是你赢了，我就此生再不踏入王城一步。","id":461},{"type":"text","text":"“不。赌什么都可以，只要不是这个。”","id":462},{"type":"text","text":"艾里尔那时明明拒绝，是自己半是赌气半是玩笑地坚持己见，险些把他急哭，对吗？","id":463},{"type":"text","text":"是的，是的。因为艾里尔从前总是让步的那个，他总会答应的。","id":464},{"type":"text","text":"于是最后，他说，好啊，你要是走，那就再也不要回来。","id":465},{"type":"text","text":"而后，自己终究还是离开王城，岁月流转，艾里尔在王城中过得并不快意。","id":466},{"type":"text","text":"听说，失去了半个宫廷的人手，艾里尔甚至不是被维多利亚人，而是被操着维多利亚口音的塔拉贵族所掌控......","id":467},{"type":"dialog","id":468},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":469},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":470},{"type":"charslot","id":471},{"type":"dialog","id":472},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_59_g4_dragonsquare_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":474},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.7","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":475},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":476},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":477},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......","id":479,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"愿赌服输，拉布雷德。","id":480,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"哪怕你再眷恋那座王城，探亲的时间也已经够长了。","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"更别说现在你只是一个被火映照出的可悲的影子。伙计，总还有自己的路要走呢，别再像当年那样食言了。","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"对，对，像这样，把紫色的火从那道贯穿胸膛的伤口中取出来——","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":485},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"呜、呃......","id":486,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"呃——然后，把它还回去，还给那条已经和你走上了同一条路的红龙......","id":487,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":488},{"type":"charslot","id":489},{"type":"text","text":"放逐王的表情因痛苦扭曲，却仍一点一点地把手伸向红龙骨骸的眼眶。","id":490},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#9$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"咳、咳，呃啊啊啊......","id":492,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"让我们看看，艾里尔，是你的剑......","id":493,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":494},{"type":"charslot","id":495},{"type":"text","text":"幻影也会感到痛苦，会因痛苦而哭泣吗？还是说这只是雨水滴穿自己逐渐透明的躯体？","id":496},{"type":"text","text":"他已经分辨不清了。","id":497},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$1","afrom":"0.5","ato":"0.5","focus":"m","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......还是你这位好后裔的火焰——","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":500},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":501},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":502},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"拉布雷德！","id":504,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":505},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"none","id":506},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮猛地转过身去，广场上却已经彻底没有了任何人的影子。","id":507},{"type":"dialog","id":508},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":509},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":510},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"none","id":511},{"type":"text","text":"唯有红龙眼眶中的紫火在一瞬间爆燃，而后彻底在雨中熄灭。","id":512},{"type":"dialog","id":513},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":514},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":515},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":516},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":517},{"type":"charslot","id":518},{"type":"background","id":519},{"type":"image","id":520}],"characters":["“校官”","爱布拉娜","阿赫茉妮","巨龙","拉芙希妮","布莉吉","敏感的居民","涅梅丝","？？？","“放逐王”"]}